// 本文件源码取自同一游戏的源码版（033-2 longyunmeng），用 v22pre11 编译器重新编译，与本版的 .b 二进制完全一致。
// Source taken from the source edition of this game (033-2); it compiles to the same program as this edition's .b binary.
// sword.c

#include <weapon.h>

#ifdef AS_FEATURE
#include <dbase.h>
#else
inherit EQUIP;
#endif

varargs void init_spear(int damage, int flag)
{
	// if( clonep(this_object()) ) return;

	set("weapon_prop/damage", damage);
	set("flag", (int)flag | EDGED);
	set("skill_type", "spear");
	set("attack_distance",2);
	if( !query("actions") ) {
		set("actions", (: call_other,WEAPON_D, "query_action" :) );
		set("verbs", ({ "slash", "slice", "thrust" }) );
	}
}

string type(){ return "weapon"; }
